      "explanation": "The view class CourseTeamManageAPIView only sets permission_classes = (IsAuthenticated,) which only ensures the request is from an authenticated user, but the bulk role operation endpoint does not enforce any role-based permission (e.g., admin or staff) before allowing role assignments. The code relies on later checks in _handle_role_assignment_entry, but those checks only verify that the user is staff/superuser or has instructor access to the specific course/org. There is no overall permission check that restricts the endpoint to authorized administrators, allowing any authenticated user to potentially trigger role changes for courses they have access to, which may be insufficient per policy requiring explicit permission checks for API actions.",
